Review Fix #288 — PhBOX readable assistiti migration diagnostics.

Base requirement:
- branch must be created from main HEAD d4ed96378f3ae6fecca46510d56933d82110a8d6;
- if main changed after that SHA, stop and regenerate;
- reviewed HEAD must match latest PR HEAD.

Scope allowed:
- lib/data/multitenant/readers/real_assistiti_migration_audit_reader.dart
- lib/data/multitenant/mappers/real_assistiti_migration_block_diagnostic_mapper.dart
- test/data/multitenant/readers/real_assistiti_migration_audit_reader_test.dart
- test/data/multitenant/mappers/real_assistiti_migration_block_diagnostic_mapper_test.dart
- no UI change
- no dashboard switch
- no backend_gas
- no writer change
- no verifier change
- no legacy write
- no Gmail/Drive/PDF lifecycle

Intent:
- add readable diagnostics for Migration 1 assistiti audit statuses and blocking reasons;
- keep audit read-only and redacted;
- do not change copy behavior;
- do not force any blocked CF to become copyable.

Specific focus:
- diagnostics are generated by pure mapper only;
- copyable items have no diagnostics;
- already_target items get informational diagnostic, not blocked diagnostic;
- already_target remains separate from blocked;
- legacy_source_missing gets readable explanation and recommended action;
- target_identity_absent gets readable explanation and recommended action;
- target_duplicate_guard_missing_result gets readable explanation and recommended action;
- unknown reasons get safe fallback diagnostic;
- diagnostics do not expose raw legacyBundle;
- diagnostics do not expose targetPreviewPayloadWithoutAssistitoId;
- diagnostics do not expose raw dryRunPreview;
- diagnosticCodeCounts are bounded aggregate counts only;
- blockingReasonCounts still counts only status == blocked items;
- no Firestore set/update/delete/writeBatch/transaction is introduced;
- no listener/snapshots/polling is introduced;
- no collectionGroup is introduced;
- no patients documents are modified;
- no patient_dashboard_index documents are modified;
- no patient_therapeutic_advice documents are modified;
- no doctor_patient_links documents are modified;
- no drive_pdf_imports documents are modified;
- no Gmail/Drive/PDF lifecycle calls are introduced;
- no trigger or runPhboxBackendSimple call is introduced.

Test focus:
- mapper tests cover copyable item diagnostics empty;
- mapper tests cover already_target informational diagnostic;
- mapper tests cover legacy_source_missing;
- mapper tests cover unknown blocking reason fallback;
- mapper tests cover blocked item without reasons;
- audit tests verify diagnostics appear in toMap;
- audit tests verify raw payload remains redacted;
- audit tests verify already_target is not blocked.

Merge allowed only if:
- files changed are exactly in scope;
- no P1/P2;
- Actions/checks are green.

