#### Problem
non voting validators have an empty authorized voter set:
https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/blob/1989ee8fd1feea77b65dfc4c96ecddd8a0e93369/core/src/validator.rs#L803-L805

If this is the case we should return `NonVoting` rather than the current thing which returns 
```
[2026-05-23T15:30:29.082101113Z WARN  agave_votor::voting_utils] Failed to generate vote and push to votes: VoteAccountNotFound(Z6x2Wq6KpnCpfZ3zdE1wJ3Z4CJqVGUgRNKqzW1Cr9yG)
```
(a random vote account 🤦 since `vote_account` is a required option for `Validator::new` )
```rust
    let vote_account = pubkey_of(matches, "vote_account").unwrap_or_else(|| {
        if !validator_config.voting_disabled {
            warn!("--vote-account not specified, validator will not vote");
            validator_config.voting_disabled = true;
        }
        Keypair::new().pubkey()
    });
```

#### Summary of Changes
If authorized voters is empty, return `NonVoting`

Fixes https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/issues/12704
